package com.sham.classloadersubsystem;

/*🔹 Delegation Hierarchy Algorithm (Step-by-step)
	
	1.Application Class Loader receives a request to load a class.
	2.Instead of loading it directly, it delegates the request to its parent (Extension Class Loader).
	3.The Extension Class Loader again delegates to its parent → Bootstrap Class Loader.
	4.Bootstrap Class Loader tries to load the class:
	  -> If the class is found in jrt.jar (core classes) → it is loaded.
	  -> If not found → the request is passed back to the Extension Class Loader.
	5.Extension Class Loader now tries:
	  -> found in jre/lib/ext → it loads the class.
	  -> Otherwise, it passes back to Application Class Loader
	6.Application Class Loader loads the class from the classpath.
	7.If not found anywhere → ClassNotFoundException is thrown..
	
	
	      [Bootstrap Class Loader]
                    ↑
          [Extension Class Loader]
                    ↑
        [Application/System Class Loader]
                    ↑
          [User-defined classes]

*/

